          ],
          "source": null,
          "content": "    # Authorization check (create_run action on threads resource)\n    ctx = build_auth_context(user, \"threads\", \"create_run\")",
          "snapshot": null,
          "snapshot_conflict": false,
          "grounded_in_pr": false
        }
      ],
      "suggested_fix": "Restore the ownership check to ensure the user owns the thread before proceeding. The generic authorization check does not verify object-level ownership. Add back the logic to fetch the thread and verify existing_thread.user_id == user.identity, or integrate this ownership check into the build_auth_context logic if it supports object-level checks.",
